{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_10_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_10","title":"1:11A.M.","storyCode":"CB-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"4563574737795d373dac87852b05a2a20f866a920bef3c19b41a446493142472","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......就這麼看著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼看著。雖然不知道是怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"但反正沒有殃及無辜對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多美食和飲料，就這麼浪費了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼浪費看的我都心疼。但我總覺得，這場鬥毆好像也是派對的一部分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"安排好的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"也不太像，啊，有人衝過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！怎麼......好像......打錯人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"待在這兒是不是有點不太安全？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"反正回事務所也不知道該幹嘛，都快通宵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是明天還要考試？下午？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......糟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊兩位，似乎不是這場鬧劇的相關人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"應該建議他們遠離這裡，不小心會受傷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著，那個肚子上被開了個洞的人，是企鵝物流的大帝吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"他死了喔，你們就不慌張嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"慌張？怎麼會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生每個月都會有那麼幾次玩火自焚。我們習以為常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕他死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......莫斯提馬也許真的不該和你們走得太近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"你在擔心她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來確保她沒有做出什麼出格的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，嗯，真是拙劣的演技，既然她那麼有閒情逸致，那看來應該沒什麼值得注意的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"先走一步。還有，不要告訴她我來過這裡，等完事了我會去找她的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......走掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"突然出現，突然質問，又突然離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭現在已經變成這個風格了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，我突然開始有些羡慕你這樣的年輕人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你們總是喜歡自顧自地選擇自己的道路，全然不顧自己在時局中的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是有在好好工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但是從來沒有人能夠查清你的根底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的查到了什麼，那才是最麻煩的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"說得對，有些事情的確不該過度深究，特別是和信使莫斯提馬扯上關係的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這算什麼？職業歧視嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"只是經驗談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，先暫停一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"法術被壓制了.....？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，原來一直在手下留情的人其實是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"彼此彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少，你拖延了足夠的時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你這臭小子，怎麼這麼耐打......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，呼啊，論耐力，我，可不會，輸給任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真虧你們能這麼快解決那麼多的敵人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，這次不會再讓你一個人突然消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這傢伙就是幕後黑手吧？當然要親手暴揍他一頓啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的運動量真是超乎想像，唔，帳單長度也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯姐，我感覺今晚有很多東西沒法報銷啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不要問我，問老闆去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"但是老闆他死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就一會再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，沒有人去照顧一下老闆的屍體嗎？就那麼躺在地上被踩來踩去的，是不是有點......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，人都到齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......年輕人總會做出自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"即使會在風雨飄搖的大地上粉身碎骨，你們也總是如此執意行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"他在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子的碎碎念，忘了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"就當是這樣吧，安魂夜還開心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"還好啦，就和宿醉一樣，絕對不能去想第二天該怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"所以沒有人去照顧一下老闆嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......企鵝物流，還真是讓人捉摸不透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今也沒必要在意這點了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流就是企鵝物流，開戰的理由也只是老闆被人質疑了品味，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"為了捍衛自己的美學付出生命也在所不惜，這才是大帝嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在讓人意外這方面，你們倒是從未讓我感到過意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦！哪來的沙子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"他還有餘力嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯，都認真一點，這和那些打打鬧鬧可不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬間都不要鬆懈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜怎麼能不熱鬧一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我親眼見識見識，大帝究竟飼養著一群怎樣的怪胎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"劍碰到沙子就斷開了......真麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這麼多年了，膽敢直接近身對我舞刀弄槍的人可不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼嘗嘗這個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，果然沒用！可頌，交給你啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的錘子已經被流沙纏住了喔！動都動不了喔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"白費力氣。只是這樣嗎，企鵝物流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是這樣喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"沙盾被打破了，趁現在，能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"彈幕射擊時間到——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......複數的守護銃？真是麻煩的天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"別想得逞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？竟然擋住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"謝啦，拜松！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我！別怪我對老年人下手太重！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！還是沒打中！！德克薩斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"休想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我，德克薩斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，利用聲音的源石技藝，有趣的小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有空，東張西望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那種角度，竟然被避開了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少讓他挪了一步，一直站著不動對付我們，總覺得被小看了似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那件大衣，是我的女兒送給我的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年，你是第一個能碰到它的外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門有多少像你們這樣的年輕人呢，你們究竟又能擔任什麼樣的位置呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"做自己就好了吧，還是說，你生氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是有些五味雜陳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但是夜晚的時間所剩無幾，是時候——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他被擊中了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......是那個狙擊手，從剛才起，一直在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......目標沉默，前去確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......少爺，他很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不應該這麼接近他，他有驅動源石技藝的傾向，這個距離，我沒法保證您的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少爺的安全是第一優先，請您理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道說，我只是個誘餌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"父親知道這些事情，所以他才派你來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少爺......有些事和您想的不太一樣，到時候你就會明白了。我向您保證，老爺沒有任何利用您的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，企鵝物流也會需要一個解釋。但現在，我必須確認鼠王的生死，我得帶走他的遺體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係，老闆不在，現在也沒人聽你解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感謝理解。那麼，少爺，請保重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——拜松，現在不是深究這件事的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王還給我們留下了一份大禮，不要忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定是炸彈喔，畢竟那個敘拉古人最喜歡炸彈了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是不太妙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"而且敵人也沒有完全潰散，他們像是在等著我們一樣，怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王就這麼被帶走了，他們竟然一點反應都沒有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":".....是啊，他們竟然一點反應都沒有，唔......應該是這麼回事吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"分頭行動。空，可頌，能天使，我們壓制住剩下的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松和莫斯提馬，解決那份禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"就快日出了，我們的時間不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，到底會在哪兒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你很慌張，不要總是這麼急躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是突然發現原來我一直被蒙在鼓裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......莫斯提馬小姐，我們之前，是不是和鼠王照過面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你從一開始就猜到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要蒙混過關！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我也猜不透他到底在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是時間的確不多了，近衛局會坐不住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近已經一團亂麻了，算上湊熱鬧的，根本沒法好好偵查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......維多利亞軟糖，糖果盒，也許是個線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不過按照常理來考慮，重複使用同一種陷阱是非常愚蠢的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"如果鼠王真的料到了今晚發生的一切，我們早些時候遇到他就必定不是偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，他就在和我們對話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這是他的陷阱，為什麼還要給我們提示？這說不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，也許我們不該這麼武斷地與他為敵......但是，我有這種直覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是猜想，是見到鼠王之後，他始終在嘗試暗示某種東西......之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......聽上去比毫無頭緒要好得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":".....這個就是——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"長寬約八十釐米，高四十釐米，放在一個鐵盒裡——嗯，這算是個大號驚奇禮盒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"能、能拆解嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我一點都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼趕緊聯繫德克薩斯他們，也許他們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎來不及了。這大概是定時型的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"真是炸彈！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，有點老套。我是說它的造型。當然，這件事本身也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......莫斯提馬小姐，你先走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"賭一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這面盾牌是特製的，我的身體也還算結實，就算押錯注，說不定還有活下來的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"當真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我見證到最後吧。不用擔心，也許我也可以縮減爆炸的損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這是工作嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——動手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你決定了？可那根和我頭髮的顏色好像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！莫、莫斯提馬！不要突然開玩笑！我差點就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"計數歸零！快躲在我身後！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不燙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼，糖果！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，注意落地姿勢，不然會摔傷喔。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_7_back"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_7_fro"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚，但——哇！有人從天上飛過來了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼，今天怎麼總是......啊！抱、抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"還好啦，你們在玩什麼，空中飛人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"疼！什麼東西砸著我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......糖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"天上，在掉糖果？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，空氣裡的甜膩味更重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，差不多該收手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯？德克薩斯，你是不是知道些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。但是能猜出個大概來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"誒！！你有什麼線索就早點說啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜，早就過了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王的部下","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......喝早茶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時間？那不如去天台看日出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王的部下","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些黑手黨真有意思，總喜歡去天台看日出......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，這糖果砸得我腦殼叮噹響——這是停手的信號，都住手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"說是住手，可根本就是我們被單方面毆打。疼，渾身疼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，真的停下了，怎麼回事，總覺得哪裡不太對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然就安靜下來了？大家就這麼喜歡糖果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......糖果雨停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，很短暫吧。如果天上真的能掉下糖果就好了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是有糖果這麼一回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不對，那炸彈呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你說這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？你把它整個拆下來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓一讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，稍微有點沒控制好，但願沒燒焦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這就只是個普通鐵盒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......裡面還有一把糖果，呃，全都融化了，黏黏的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這個便利貼是？訊息？鼠王留下的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"寫著什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"“安魂夜快樂”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"............哈？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["德克薩斯","拜松"]}]}
